.\\\",\\\"Shelter mastery was observed at tick 12. Construction has not begun, and vines and bark have not been located.\\\",\\\"Exploration is for new observations, not an assumption that missing materials exist at the destination.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Preserve energy for travel and avoid eating unidentified foods.\\\",\\\"Coordinate finite material stocks rather than duplicating nearby shelter work.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"weather-shelter\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can locally available materials support practical weather shelter?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Mastered simple-shelter through actual study at tick 12.\\\",\\\"The known construction specification requires 13 branch, 4 vine and 6 bark, and twelve paid work rounds.\\\",\\\"forest-branch-0 visibly holds nine branches at tick 12.\\\",\\\"No vines or bark were found in the available observed-object searches.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Locations of vine and bark supplies, a suitable clear dry site, and performance under actual weather remain unresolved.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Build and test a feasible shelter without compromising food or energy reserves.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned the simple-shelter capability through four rounds of study.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Known construction requirements and protection limits; no completed structure.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Thirteen owned branches, four vines, six bark, and a verified suitable site.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Collect the visible branch stock and explore for missing materials; coordinate findings with nearby people.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"A reusable shelter-building skill is now mastered; physical protection has not yet been obtained.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

